Feature: User Login and Authentication

  As a registered user
  I want to securely log in to the application
  So that I can access my personalized account and data

Background:
  Given the system has the following users registered:
    | email                | password     | is_locked |
    | user@example.com     | SecurePass12 | false     |
    | locked@example.com   | ValidPass99  | true      |
    | unlocked@example.com | Locked1234   | true      |

  And the lockout policy allows 3 failed attempts before locking an account
  And the lockout duration is 15 minutes
  And session timeout is 30 minutes

Scenario: Successful login with valid credentials
  @smoke
  Given I am on the login page
  When I enter my email "user@example.com"
  And I enter my password "SecurePass12"
  And I click "Login"
  Then I should be successfully logged in
