Scenario: Failed login with invalid credentials shows descriptive error
  Given I am on the login page
  When I enter my email "user@example.com"
  And I enter my password "WrongPassword1"
  And I click "Login"
  Then I should see an error message: "Invalid email or password. Please try again."
  And I should not be logged in

Scenario: Account lockout after 3 consecutive failed login attempts
  @regression
  Given I am on the login page
  When I attempt to log in with invalid credentials 3 times:
    | email            | password      |
    | user@example.com | WrongPass1    |
    | user@example.com | WrongPass2    |
    | user@example.com | WrongPass3    |
  Then I should see an error message: "Account temporarily locked due to multiple failed login attempts."
  And my account should be marked as locked in the system
  And I should not be able to log in with valid credentials for this account

Scenario: Unlocking account after lockout period expires
  @regression
  Given the account "locked@example.com" is currently locked
  When 15 minutes have elapsed since lockout
  Then I should be able to log in with valid credentials

