Scenario: Password reset token expires after use or timeout
  @edge
  Given I have an expired password reset token
  When I visit the password reset URL with the token
  Then I should see: "This password reset link is no longer valid."
  And I should not be able to change the password

Scenario: Session expires after 30 minutes of inactivity
